--
N5008 [dcl.init.aggr]/4,5,16, [dcl.init.string]/1: array default member
initializers of scalars, arrays (nested lists and brace elision),
aggregates, classes with a constructor and a string literal; elements
without an initializer-clause are value-initialized (`int part[3] = {9};'
leaves part[2] == 0).  On bin53 nested lists aborted symbolic execution
(simplifier postcondition), the pr elements found no constructor, and
the missing elements were indeterminate.  g++ 13 and clang++ 18 accept the
program.
